{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01776","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难五首 三 · 贺兰进明","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见荒树枝，春花落尽蜂不窥。\n君不见梁上泥，秋风始高燕不栖。\n荡子从军事征战，蛾眉婵娟空守闺。\n独宿自然堪下泪，况复时闻乌夜啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺兰进明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}